      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它、它吃掉了我的手，哈、哈哈，我怎么一点感觉不到疼，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
