      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你没事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你为什么才来！！为什么没有人敲钟！那个守岁的僧人去哪儿了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明明是信任你们，才按你们说的去做的，为什么！为什么我丈夫会死！你们要怎么赔，要怎么赔！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......先离开这里再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔啊啊——妈妈，妈妈，你还我妈妈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唔哦！这次也是千钧一发啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叔、叔叔，妈妈，妈妈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "先不论这个小家伙，外面好像有些不得了的大玩意啊，小姑娘，抓好了，咱们要开溜了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘎啊——！嘎啊！"
