      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只解决眼前的敌人而不注意全方位的动静，迟早会吃亏的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊、啊哈哈......刚才可真险呐！多亏了恩人，我才能安然无恙呀。"
