      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好啦，赶紧带着剩下的人避难去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "呃，恩人您？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？没关系，我脚步很轻，它们发现不了我的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "（就这身手，脚步轻就能解释得了吗！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之后......该怎么迅速削减这些墨魉的数量呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咿呀！园、园子里的火光是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "唔哦！火光冲天，蔚为壮观！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "唔？莫非“炎熔”二字，便取此中意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......帮我确定附近所有敌人的分布范围。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么大阵仗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "本来担心波及到周遭的建筑，一直不怎么敢随便用法术......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......但敌人太多了，这样慢吞吞对付下去，受害者数量恐怕难以估量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明白，特殊时期特殊手段嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我去找个高处，你就安心施法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有超出法术范围的敌人我都会帮忙解决的，保证一个不落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "之后的任务报告我来提交......毕竟罗德岛该帮助的，不止是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "怎么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......没什么，在此之前，小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有看到煮伞先生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
